  "assumptions": [
    "The original applied binary64 f, q, operators, geometry, hardware and source interaction laws remain immutable. No new response, native FEA, CAD or design revision is computed.",
    "Use only the certified distinct invariant K0 comparator and its exact 800-dimensional registered rigid kernel. The literal rounded K fails that premise and is not covered.",
    "The three alpha/beta intervals are mathematical sensitivity families, not physical minima/maxima. Their core is in Loewner order between alpha*K0 and beta*K0 with the same kernel, and variable scalar spring coefficients have the same positive interval.",
    "Panel screw/contact and floor normal/XY laws stay fixed. Every source lateral direction, positive axial component, contact cone and radial clearance remains in the calculation.",
    "A weighted-L1 LP near the saved spring weights only selects a static witness. The 1e-5-N strict margin, source-scaled variables and solver tolerances are construction controls, not actual pressure, pretension, capacity or certification.",
    "The frozen exact minor inverse bound corrects original p=R.T*f exactly with strictly positive one-sided weights; every selected component correction has the certified bound. No g0 load correction is discarded.",
    "For h=f-K0*q-B.T*x_star, exact rigid balance implies h in range K0. Each certified G block bounds its complementary norm by the squared free-coordinate residual box divided by its proved positive eigenvalue lower bound.",
    "The core Fenchel gap is bounded by half (sqrt(eta*q.K0.q)+sqrt(h.K0^+h/alpha)) squared; scalar/radial conjugates retain positive cones and clearance work. Convexity in each spring coefficient puts its maximum at an interval endpoint.",
    "Rational upper rounding and square-root enclosures use 24 decimal places and round outward. Positive tiny terms are never dropped. Local upper rounding prevents uncontrolled denominator growth in long sums.",
    "Strong convexity of each spring conjugate bounds weighted reaction differences by twice the certified total gap. Exact weighted-Gram spectral and correction-box bounds apply to local ports, world bearing resultants/couples, capture forces and leg-normal sums.",
    "Reuse only catalog wood-land areas and their source identities from the older frozen bound record; its invalid literal-matrix reaction enclosure is not transferred. Compare a world-force norm upper to the same 625-psi mean-pressure marker, separate from local crushing or washer bending.",
    "Positive rear-leg normal lower bounds would certify that model-support condition for a declared family. Nonpositive lower bounds are inconclusive, not unbearing states or failures. Physical no-slip/floor assumptions remain unverified.",
    "Enclosures cover every attained comparator equilibrium; the existing recession and certified-core records establish conditional existence. Auxiliary witnesses and saved q are not newly admitted equilibrium reactions or displacements.",
    "Complete cleat/joint/finished-member and brittle/local resistance, finite geometry, physical stiffness/contact applicability and physical restraints remain separate.",
    "Preserve 100 bolts/66 Hillman axes, rejected proposal history, panel/screw deferral, excluded actual fit and blank observations. No staging, publication, archive or prune."
